OL,3,GNEWSATaoiseach says greater clarity
OL,4,Aneeded over border poll call
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaoiseach (Irish prime minister)
OL,7,FMicheal Martin has said there needs to
OL,8,Fbe greater clarity about what would
OL,9,Flead to a border poll being called.
OL,11,FMartin was speaking ahead of his first
OL,12,Fmeeting later this month with Prime
OL,13,FMinister Andy Burnham.
OL,15,FMartin said that in his view it's "not
OL,16,Fsatisfactory"that the decision to call
OL,17,Fa referendum is left simply as a
OL,18,F'judgement call" for the Northern
OL,19,FIreland secretary.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
